Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.24,0:00:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}收拾了行李 整理着包裹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}从形影不离到轻易的割舍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}或者说 我们的爱怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.15,0:00:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}细数着我们的过往
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}想到又迷惘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}你曾是我心中唯一的信仰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但怎么你离去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}从我的世界里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.58,0:00:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}恍惚间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我还是会想起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}但回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.85,0:00:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}珍贵的点点滴滴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}再没什么意义
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}爱怎么随风而起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.45,0:00:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}又消散风雨里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.02,0:00:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}找个理由
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.15,0:00:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}却骗不过自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}到结局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.40,0:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}我只是可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.72,0:00:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}不太够时间去拥抱你
